{'symbol': 'TSLA', 'date': '2019-10-19 22:30:00', 'title': 'MASDAR CITY AND EKAR BRING FIRST TESLA CAR-SHARE OPERATION TO MIDDLE EAST', 'text': 'OCT 20  - MASDAR CITY ::EKAR HAS ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WITH MASDAR TO BRING ELECTRIC VEHICLE CAR-SHARING TO MIDDLE EAST BY INTRODUCING FIVE TESLA MODELS S AND X INTO ITS FLEET.VEHICLES ARE NOW AVAILABLE TO HIRE FROM MASDAR CITY IN ABU DHABI.ANNOUNCEMENT FOLLOWS MASDAR’S £35 MILLION INVESTMENT INTO CHARGING INFRASTRUCTURE INVESTMENT FUND.'}